                <pb facs="1089" n="1061" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v14p1/pg1061"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952–1954. China and Japan (In Two Parts): Volume
                    XIV. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#pgXIV">List of Abbreviations and Symbols,
                            Page XIV</ref> (date of correction: May 24, 2013)</hi></p>
                <p>Duplicate entry for JNPR (Japanese National Police Reserve) has been deleted.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
